          "name": "Description",
          "type": "dataObjectReference"
        },
        {
          "documentation": "<p>The job description received from the specialist department has to be completed (layout, additional information etc.) to a job advertisement in accordance to the guidelines and approved by the Hiring Manager.</p>",
